# Frontend

React (Vite) + Tailwind + react-i18next. App-like mobile web, not a marketing site.

- Screens in `frontend/src/screens/`; shared UI in `frontend/src/components/`
- All user-facing strings via i18n keys (`en` + `sw`). No hardcoded English.
- Persist locale in `localStorage`. Call backend with `?lang=`
- Bottom nav: Score / Loan / Improve. Lookup has no nav.
- Score tab: number + band, climate card, why, strengths, gaps (2 max). No nested phone mockup.
- Loan tab: server-calculated amount only; locked explainer if not eligible
- Improve tab: action cards with how / impact / points; self-report never changes the score
- Cache last-viewed profile for flaky networks; show it if the live call fails
- Kali greeting: play `voiceGreetingUrl` when present; else speak `voiceGreetingText`
- Self-report checkboxes call `POST /api/readiness/:lookup/actions/:id/complete` only
